WEBVTT

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.430
What incredible overpower.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:45.270
Because he's inexperienced,
he grows precisely as expected.

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:49.400
I'm delighted he decided to join us.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:54.290
He doesn't know where the
barrier is, but it doesn't matter.

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.530
Chihiro-san...

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.660
Now I get why there was nothing for us to do.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:08.240
We were never strong enough for this mission.

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:10.540
However...

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:20.600
If it means saving our future,
I'll destroy Tokyo!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:01.030
Why Do I Love My Despised Enemy

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.740
How long will you keep dragging your feet?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:09.060
It matters little if the barrier
is destroyed now,

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.410
but why do you continue to
allow the church's Heroic Lineage

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.180
to do as they please?

00:03:14.180 --> 00:03:18.700
We have information on them, but
the two of us have reached our limit.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:22.760
We're especially weakened in areas
where the gates can't be opened.

00:03:23.350 --> 00:03:26.010
When will you be able to send <i>them</i>?

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:32.020
Don't you dare casually refer to them.

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:37.030
Then you won't have a problem with us
finding reinforcements ourselves.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.730
We'll be back.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:44.140
Wait.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.020
I'm sorry.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.650
I don't actually want to put you in danger.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.960
But try to understand.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.580
You're the only one who can save me.

00:04:03.650 --> 00:04:05.820
Yes, Father.

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:08.040
Good girl.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:14.780
Well done, everyone.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.150
You achieved fantastic results.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:21.400
You destroyed barriers in two locations
in such a short amount of time.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.400
Aren't they using too much power?

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.120
They're not used to it yet.

00:04:25.810 --> 00:04:26.510
Yeah.

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:27.710
It's fine.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:30.910
If my power can help...

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.880
Barriers have been erected around Tokyo.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.260
In order to remove their power,

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:40.860
we must destroy the spiritual
sites protecting them.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.010
Kamina-kun's savage power is a great asset.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:48.680
B-But Chihiro-san won't last.

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.880
The agents of Chaos will continue turning
people into gates to other worlds.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.130
But...

00:04:57.130 --> 00:04:59.340
Once we destroy all the barriers,

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:03.240
Tokyo will crumble on its own.

00:05:03.810 --> 00:05:07.950
Then we'll be able to stop their atrocities.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.170
To prevent any more casualties...

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.830
Chihiro-san!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.000
Are you okay?

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:16.520
I had a dream.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.240
Huh?

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.250
Someone else might fall victim again.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.470
I couldn't bear that.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.660
Unless we destroy the barriers,
the future can't be saved.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:31.650
But will that really...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.850
Are you willing to sacrifice yourself?

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.360
You need rest now.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.910
Can you take him to his room?

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:47.100
I wish I could go with you, but
Sakiyama's waiting for me at the hospital.

00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:48.000
Sure.

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.820
Let me know if anything comes up.

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.860
I'll prepare his bed.

00:05:57.780 --> 00:05:59.330
Did you have fun?

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:04.020
Kakihara-san.

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:06.720
What are you talking about?

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.440
Of course it wasn't fun.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:13.970
Didn't you get to lose yourself in violence?

00:06:15.010 --> 00:06:16.610
You jerk!

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:20.300
Chihiro-san's not doing
this because he wants to!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.070
He's experiencing catharsis after
surrendering himself to destruction.

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:30.070
Or are you not satisfied unless
you kill someone yourself?

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.950
That's enough!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:35.600
Why didn't you participate in the mission when
you're a Vessel of Heroic Blood, too?!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:37.960
He's not destructive for
someone else's sake.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:43.210
I won't be swayed by your
reeking stench of death.

00:07:13.090 --> 00:07:14.450
How are you feeling?

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:26.270
Cerdid.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:27.880
What's wrong?

00:07:33.780 --> 00:07:36.080
Wait up, Haru.

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:39.100
It's finally happening. The head's recognized me.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.400
He says he needs my strength.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:45.480
You're still hanging out with that biker gang?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.610
It's Blue Skull!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:50.490
They're not like those guys who
are happy just making noise!

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.410
Hey, it's time fo—

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:58.740
Inuki!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.870
Inuki!

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.200
Hang in there!

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.250
Medicine...

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.040
Let's not do this tonight, okay?

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:20.750
Sorry. Could you go by yourself?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:21.770
But...

00:08:22.860 --> 00:08:28.550
Things will become inconvenient if you don't go.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:35.240
She who controls information
controls everything!

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.400
Second summer president, Tsubaki the Red,
also known as Manazuru Tsubaki,

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:42.200
is on the way!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.920
What are you doing here?

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.280
That guy...

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.440
You idiot!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:17.530
You can't summon monsters
without people around!

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.620
That's one.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:36.220
Don't go charging in so recklessly!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.400
Kotetsu!

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:46.060
Kamina, the barrier!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.850
Help Koume-san!

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.330
Kamina!

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.830
A defender...

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:13.670
What are they doing here?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.410
Damn.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.060
Who are you?

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:34.050
Why are you hesitating against a novice?

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.070
Will you offer me some entertainment?

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:41.460
You can tell me all about it in the ICU.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.480
Damn.

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:49.640
I'm here!

00:10:51.820 --> 00:10:55.350
Huh? Are you new?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:11:00.690
But I'm after the head! Y'know, the h-e-a-d.

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.750
Not small fries.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:04.350
You're one of them?

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:08.150
The barrier...

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:21.710
Don't resist.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:25.950
Stay out of my way!

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:58.930
What?

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:16.420
Where are we?

00:12:17.230 --> 00:12:18.700
This isn't a place.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:23.670
If I had to say, it's a memory.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.570
Huh? What's that?

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:38.770
Chihiro.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.230
Hey!

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:43.700
What did you do?

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.690
How the hell should I know?!

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.400
You can't summon them here, can you?

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:52.790
What was that?

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:55.580
Not bad.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.420
Then I won't hold back.

00:12:57.770 --> 00:12:58.990
Densuke!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:10.420
You won't be able to escape
by wandering aimlessly.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.180
Don't follow me.

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.270
Or are you plotting something?

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:20.160
If you won't answer my questions, keep quiet.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:24.200
Do you really think you're right?

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:27.910
Shut up. If you know the way, tell me.

00:13:28.850 --> 00:13:32.040
No. I'm talking about destroying Tokyo.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.380
Do you really think it's right?

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:39.120
I have to save everyone.

00:13:40.180 --> 00:13:41.580
"Everyone" meaning who?

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:44.960
What about the people still living in Tokyo?

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:50.520
If you destroy all the barriers,
Tokyo will crumble.

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:53.960
Most people won't survive.

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.700
Will you kill the innocent?

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.520
You're the one turning people into gates.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.400
Are you saying it's okay
to turn them into monsters?

00:14:13.590 --> 00:14:15.540
You transformed them.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:19.750
Ikuro, Kotetsu's dad. Because of you...

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:24.480
But I'll stop you.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:30.970
<i>Kamina, where did you go?</i>

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.760
What?

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:44.210
I lost Chihiro's Arcana.

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.240
Damn.

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:49.420
Where do I go to get out of here?

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:56.400
Maybe it's better that we can't escape.

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:58.640
You want to die here?

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.750
I don't mind.

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:05.750
As long as I'm with you.

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:09.440
It would be for the best.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:12.320
You and I will be saved.

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:15.950
Shut up.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.480
You don't understand.

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:19.770
I...

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:24.210
There's no salvation anywhere.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:31.480
But if I can eventually find
forgiveness by fighting,

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:32.550
then I...

00:15:34.060 --> 00:15:40.660
So who cares if a world made
only of despair is destroyed?

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:43.720
Who cares if I break it?

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:48.800
Was there really only despair?

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.340
Why don't we become allies?

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:01.810
If you want, let's change the world together.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:04.810
Are you serious?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.410
Let's leave this place together.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:09.600
I'll vouch for you.

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:15.920
In other words, you know
how to get out of here.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.070
Jun-san!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.180
I did it! I hit her!

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.430
Good job, Haru.

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:48.440
Bring it on, asshole.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.820
If you won't tell me, then leave me alone.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:56.230
Don't follow me.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.080
Wrong way.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:08.000
This way.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.300
Ready to surrender?

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:19.300
I won't lose to someone who
turns people into gates!

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.110
Gates? Don't be stupid!

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.810
I'm not some vulgar agent of Chaos!

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.230
Huh?

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:28.030
What?

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:32.350
Um, you're not an agent of Chaos?

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.530
Huh? What about you?

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:42.790
Whoops, my bad. I made a mistake.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.590
A mistake?

00:17:45.820 --> 00:17:48.680
You're not too bad, though!

00:17:48.680 --> 00:17:50.890
See ya later!

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:51.800
What?

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.540
This is the center.

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:12.560
I knew this existed in the same
location in the real world.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:16.910
A tremendous amount of power
was poured into this rock,

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:19.930
summoning us to a place that doesn't exist.

00:18:20.460 --> 00:18:23.220
If we channel an equal
amount of energy into it,

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.060
we may be able to return.

00:19:05.260 --> 00:19:06.240
Not like that.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:10.150
Stand back.

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.330
Stay out of my way.

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:18.690
If we entered using my strength,
then we can exit using it.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:20.020
Isn't that what you said?

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:22.470
Not by just smashing your power against it.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.430
I can't change anything from in here.

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.910
I have to destroy Tokyo, and the future.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:32.400
Despair, too.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:35.110
No!

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:41.510
Don't release your power by force.

00:19:41.510 --> 00:19:45.370
Imagine the load on your
target and control the flow.

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:13.500
That's it.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.090
Focus your power on a single point,

00:20:16.090 --> 00:20:18.110
and search for the resonance in the load.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.010
Wait.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:30.460
It's all because of your mother.

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:32.450
What?

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:38.790
Who are you?
